OL,3,GNEWSAMore remains discovered under city
OL,4,Aroundabout works
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of skeletons discovered
OL,7,Fbeneath a city roundabout during
OL,8,Fredevelopment has risen to 37,
OL,9,Farchaeologists have revealed.
OL,11,FThe discoveries were made, alongside
OL,12,Ftombs and burial chambers, under the
OL,13,FQueensgate roundabout, where seven
OL,14,Fskeletons were first found in late
OL,15,FJuly.
OL,17,FThe site is being developed as part of
OL,18,FPeterborough's City Link walkway
OL,19,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
