OL,3,GNEWSAMore remains discovered under city
OL,4,Aroundabout works
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngus Ellis, Labour councillor and
OL,7,Fcabinet member for transport at
OL,8,FPeterborough City Council, said the
OL,9,Fdiscovery could delay the project by
OL,10,F"up to eight weeks", after an initial
OL,11,Fdelay of four weeks was estimated while
OL,12,Fthe remains were removed.
